1
00:00:00,710 --> 00:00:02,130
(Leonard:)So don't call her.

2
00:00:02,295 --> 00:00:04,585
(Raj:)If I don't call her,
I won't hear the end of it.

3
00:00:04,756 --> 00:00:07,886
- So call her.
- How can I call her? I can't talk to women.

4
00:00:08,551 --> 00:00:09,761
(Leonard:)I'm done. Anybody else?

5
00:00:09,927 --> 00:00:10,927
[GRUNTS]

6
00:00:11,095 --> 00:00:12,135
- Give me the phone.
- Why?

7
00:00:12,305 --> 00:00:14,515
Just give it to me. Sh.

8
00:00:14,682 --> 00:00:17,722
- What are you doing?
- Don't worry, you'll thank me.

9
00:00:18,102 --> 00:00:20,442
[IMITATING RAJESH]
Hello, Lalita? Raj Koothrappali.

10
00:00:20,605 --> 00:00:22,395
[LAUGHING]

11
00:00:23,399 --> 00:00:26,489
(Howard:)Yes, it is good to talk to you too.

12
00:00:28,446 --> 00:00:30,406
So, what are you wearing?

13
00:00:33,326 --> 00:00:34,866
(Howard:)Oh, not important.

14
00:00:35,036 --> 00:00:37,746
(Howard:)So anyhow,
when would you like to meet?

15
00:00:38,790 --> 00:00:41,290
(Howard:)Friday works for me.

16
00:00:41,959 --> 00:00:44,419
I'll call you with a time and place.

17
00:00:44,587 --> 00:00:48,047
(Howard:)In the meantime, keep it real, babe.

18
00:00:53,971 --> 00:00:55,601
[NORMAL VOICE]
You may now thank me.

19
00:00:56,891 --> 00:01:00,021
(Raj:)For what, making me sound
like a Simpsons character?

